  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot \u015Fimdi sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "\u015Eimdi i\xE7in \"T\u0131ls\u0131m Alt\u0131l\u0131s\u0131\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    se\xE7tin.\n\nSon zamanlarda \xE7evrene kar\u015F\u0131 \xE7ok c\xF6mertsin ve
    bunun da kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 al\u0131yorsun. Kader plan\u0131nda,
    seninle ilgili bir terazi kurulmu\u015F. Sen verdik\xE7e, di\u011Fer kefe art\u0131yor.
    Sen da\u011F\u0131tt\u0131k\xE7a, \xE7o\u011Fal\u0131yorsun {{isim}}. Eline ge\xE7mekte
    olan mevduatlar artt\u0131k\xE7a bor\xE7lar\u0131n\u0131 \xF6demeye ve kurdu\u011Fun
    planlar\u0131 da yava\u015F yava\u015F hayata ge\xE7irebilmeye ba\u015Fl\u0131yorsun.
    Maddiyat, senin hayat\u0131nda \xF6nemli bir de\u011Fi\u015Fken de\u011Fil. \u0130\u015F
    ak\u0131\u015F\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011Flayan dinamiklerden yaln\u0131zca biri. Ona
    her zaman bu g\xF6zle bak\u0131yorsun ve de\u011Feri hi\xE7bir zaman gere\u011Fini
    a\u015Fam\u0131yor. \u0130nsanlara yard\u0131m etti\u011Fin m\xFCddet\xE7e bereket
    seninle; hi\xE7bir zaman elin s\u0131k\u0131\u015Fm\u0131yor.\n"
